WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.775
A birthday dinner starts with a conversation. FormBridge helps your restaurant look

00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:07.700
after everything that follows.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.837
Four guests become six. A voice message moves dinner to after eight.

00:00:12.837 --> 00:00:16.950
The brief keeps the change, and asks for the exact time.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.936
Ask the desk assistant for a warm reply, a follow-up and a

00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:25.550
note for the next shift. You choose what to keep.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.713
A birthday, a quiet table, a dietary request. Review the guest's words

00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:33.550
before keeping each detail.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.433
Save the enquiry. Plan the service, find the follow-up, and pick up

00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:40.550
the conversation when you need it.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.257
Let guests ask questions on your website, with answers from the restaurant’s

00:00:46.257 --> 00:00:47.100
approved information.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:53.658
From first hello to the next shift. Bring your own enquiries to

00:00:53.658 --> 00:00:54.150
FormBridge.
